    "description": "This service domain handles the fulfillment of a general loan product. This includes the initial set-up of the loan facility and the completion of scheduled and ad-hoc product processing tasks.\n\n## Service Domain Role:\n\nThe loan product represents a generic loan capability that may include different properties/features depending on a bank's preferences and policies. The loan may or may not be secured by collateral.\n\n## Example of Use:\n\nAn established and valued bank customer applies for and gets a loan for a home improvement project.\n\n## Key Features:\n\nSet-up a loan facility Handle deposits and withdrawals Provide statements and assessment reports on the loan Support loan restructuring\n\nContact Support:  \nName: EIS  \nEmail: [EISSupportTeam@seacoastbank.com](https://mailto:EISSupportTeam@seacoastbank.com)",
